<title>USA: Littlefield, Adams Q4 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Littlefield, Adams Q4 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr   loss	$0.09	   loss   $0.31</p>
<p> Net   loss	195	     loss   712</p>
<p> Revs		3,261		    1,837</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  2,278		    2,276</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr   profit    $0.31	   loss   $0.44</p>
<p> Net   profit    893	     loss   992</p>
<p> Revs		12,036		   14,735</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  2,968		    2,276</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Littlefield, Adams &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include a $0.03 per share extraordinary gain and 1995 results include a $0.22 per share non-recurring operating loss attributable to the company's Collegiate Pacific Division. The company shut this unit in 1995.</p>
<p>(New York newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
